<main class="page">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container split"><div class="stack"><p class="eyebrow">[[Estimation||Valuation]]</p><h1>[[Combien vaut votre bien ?||What is your home worth?]]</h1><p class="lead">[[Décrivez-le en quelques mots : un conseiller vous rappelle sous 48 heures.||Describe it in a few words: an advisor calls you back within 48 hours.]]</p></div><img class="media media--tall" src="@@agent:1000@@" alt="@@alt:agent@@"></div></section>
<section class="section section--tight"><div class="container"><form class="form form--narrow" data-revel-form="estimation"><div class="form__row"><label class="field"><span class="field__label">[[Type de bien||Property type]]</span><select class="field__input" name="type"><option>[[Maison||House]]</option><option>[[Appartement||Apartment]]</option><option>Loft</option><option>[[Terrain||Land]]</option></select></label><label class="field"><span class="field__label">[[Surface (m²)||Area (sq ft)]]</span><input class="field__input" type="number" name="[[surface||area]]" min="10"></label></div><label class="field"><span class="field__label">[[Adresse du bien||Property address]]</span><input class="field__input" type="text" name="[[adresse||address]]" autocomplete="street-address" required></label><div class="form__row"><label class="field"><span class="field__label">[[Nom||Name]]</span><input class="field__input" type="text" name="[[nom||name]]" autocomplete="name" required></label><label class="field"><span class="field__label">[[Téléphone||Phone]]</span><input class="field__input" type="tel" name="[[telephone||phone]]" autocomplete="tel" required></label></div><button class="btn" type="submit">[[Demander mon estimation||Request my valuation]]</button><p class="form__status" data-revel-form-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form></div></section>
</main>
